  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.7.0: Added dual Excel report generation engines — MiniExcel\n      (IMiniExcelReportService) for high-performance, stream-based bulk exports with minimal memory\n      overhead, and ClosedXML (IClosedXmlReportService) for advanced richly formatted workbooks with\n      corporate header styles, freeze panes, AutoFilter, alternating row shading, aggregate formula\n      totals rows, multi-sheet workbooks, and workbook metadata. Both engines include concurrency\n      control, timeout protection, and full DI integration.",
